// TS-ONLY: cross-language bincode fixture validation
//
// These tests read binary fixture files generated by the Rust side
// (ankurah-ts-support/proto/tests/bincode_fixtures.rs) and validate
// that the TypeScript bincode codec produces identical results.
//
// For each fixture we do TWO checks:
//   1. Decode the .bin file and verify field values (Rust -> TS decode).
//   2. Construct matching TS values, encode them, and compare bytes (TS encode -> Rust).

